I had a strange looking incident in Juiblex' lair...

It is not what happened so often meanwhile, as today, that Juiblex
appeared adjacent and did not move while I casted magic missile at
least four times at him until my purple worm finally decided to eat
him. No, something different... I casted charm monster, and without
realising it first I saw a couple of spawning pet gremlins. But the
gremlins suddenly morphed into vampire lords etc. What happened was
that I had tamed a sandestin (as I got aware after putting on my
ring of protection from shape changers) that became a gremlin and
spawned, but continued to change form. The resulting monsters, even
though carrying great names like "vampire lord" did not survive long;
they inherited the maxHP's (14, 1, ...) from the split gremlins. But
the short show of multiplying pets that simultaneously became a flashy
variety of monsters was nice (a bit like hallucinating). And seeing
for the first time (while wearing the ring) three sandestins at one
single location was also new to me.

